{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {"subscribe": false, "listChanged": false}, "prompts": {"listChanged": false}, "logging": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "impedance-matching-ai", "title": "Impedance Matching AI · 微波阻抗匹配与教材检索", "version": "4.3.0", "websiteUrl": "https://github.com/RuilinLu/Impedance_Matching_Calculation"}, "instructions": "这是「Impedance Matching AI」微波阻抗匹配计算、仿真与教材检索服务器。任何涉及频率、负载阻抗、L/C 元件值、VSWR、带宽、耐压的具体问题，请先调用 design_matching_network / evaluate_network / scan_matching_range 等工具，再基于工具返回值解释。topology=auto 会自动比较 L/T/π 五种拓扑。涉及教材原文、公式出处、Smith 圆图、传输线、波导、天线时，请调用 search_textbooks / read_textbook_page / translate_textbook_page；引用必须带书名与页码。软件自身的使用说明可调用 search_docs 或 get_code_reference。单位：频率 MHz，阻抗 Ω，电感 µH，电容 pF。"}}
